# Clicking a pod's `Pod ×N` tag in Station Lanes selects the pod set (as the viewport's `POD ×N` chip does).
#   cargo run -q -p bowshock -- drive --example crates/bowshock/scripts/pods-select.drive /tmp/pods-select
viewport 1280x800
scale 2
click (160, 88)
type "pod"
click "Pod / strap-on"
move (900, 300)
click (873, 628)
click (1175, 167)
type "60"
type enter
click (160, 88)
type backspace
type backspace
type backspace
type "motor mount"
click "Motor mount"
move (640, 560)
screenshot 01-pod-mount.png
# Click the `Pod ×3` tag in Propulsion: the pod set is selected (inspector shows the pod, the bracket turns accent).
click (845, 694)
move (640, 560)
screenshot 02-pod-tag-clicked.png
